          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Summary: Silent passage of a light phenomenon in train-like shape followed by a trail: observation related to the artificial atmospheric reentry of 31 March 1993 (Cyclone-M rocket).",
          "translation_text_sha256": "5a75657273daca59dc1efcd29955dc13bc615e4e757c6548de513d8313c4ab8c"
